  "meta": {
    "name": "Effects tour · 10 Music",
    "description": "The music features: a fading bed, per-section volume, a volume swell, ducking under a voice and cuts on the analysed beat.",
    "creativeDirection": "Listen with the picture: every sound lands on the frame of its visual event and is named on screen. The beat grid proves sync (each count pops on its click), the riser ends exactly on the drop, the voice beats change only the processing. Review: no sound before its picture, the ding is the only one, and voices stay clear without pumping."
